  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Sulphanilic acid is p-amino benzene sulphonic acid. It&nbsp;has no &ndash;COOH group hence no esterification test for carboxyl group.&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/087939aa-ed4c-46df-85ae-1a3ece4c1010-9896856.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 172px;\" /></p><p>But it has sulphur, and nitrogen atom hence gives red colour in Lassigne&#39;s test for extra element detection.</p><p>Hence, statement I is incorrect but statement II is correct.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
